  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: DialogueName2
  <Text>k__BackingField: Ah, yes, I have some old training swords here. I could part
    with one for <style=coin>10 coins</style> to replace it. Do we have ourselves
    a deal?
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Here's 10 coins.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ce8cdfd73efa1c458831cdbc953f676, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I can't afford that.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d8e2701e4fe9df409a4a02580996246, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I'll think about it.
